sequenceDiagram
    participant A as ESP32 A
    participant B as ESP32 B
    A->>B: Heartbeat A1
    Note over B: Receive A1 and prepare acknowledgement
    B->>A: Heartbeat B1 + acknowledgement of A1
    Note over A: Fresh reply confirms two-way contact, LED starts blinking
    A->>B: Heartbeat A2 + acknowledgement of B1
    Note over B: Fresh reply confirms two-way contact, LED starts blinking
    opt ACK missing after 300 to 400 ms
        A->>B: Retry same probe with latest acknowledgement
        Note over A,B: Up to 2 retries per probe with randomized delay
    end
    A->>B: Continue periodic heartbeats + acknowledgements
    B->>A: Continue periodic heartbeats + acknowledgements
    Note over A,B: If fresh acknowledgements stop for 3 seconds, LEDs turn off
